# @meddleware/dashboard — build-time environment
# Copy to .env.local for local dev (never commit .env.local).
# In production these are Docker --build-arg values baked into the static bundle (public values - none is a
# secret; see SECURITY.md). tests/build-inputs.test.ts keeps this file, the Dockerfile ARGs and the release
# workflow's build-args in step.
#
# The embedded tools read their own configuration from the same variables at bundle time; a tool's full
# list is in its repository (.env.example). The dashboard accepts the ones it sets for the hosted site.

# ── Shell ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Documentation URL — override to link to a custom or staging docs deployment (not a Docker build arg).
# VITE_DOCS_URL=https://docs.meddleware.co.uk/

# Developer docs URL — override to link to a custom or staging dev-docs deployment (not a Docker build arg).
# VITE_DEV_URL=https://dev.meddleware.co.uk/

# ── Embedded tools (Docker build args) ────────────────────────────────────────

# Network the app opens on (testnet until the mainnet packages and gate exist).
# VITE_NETWORK=testnet

# Walrus upload relay, per network (walrus-ui, token-deployer-ui).
# VITE_WALRUS_RELAY_TESTNET=https://sui-walrus-relay-testnet.meddleware.co.uk
# VITE_WALRUS_RELAY_MAINNET=

# Relay access gate (the published access_gate deployment's gate object), per network, and whether its
# passes are soulbound. The price is read from the chain; there is no price setting.
# VITE_ACCESS_GATE_ID_TESTNET=
# VITE_ACCESS_GATE_ID_MAINNET=
# VITE_ACCESS_GATE_SOULBOUND_TESTNET=true

# Ceiling (MIST) on the relay tip a tool will sign for.
# VITE_UPLOAD_RELAY_MAX_TIP_MIST=5000000

# Sui full node (gRPC) override per network (token-deployer-ui). Unset: the public fullnode. The release
# build does not pass these; they are for operator builds.
# VITE_RPC_TESTNET=
# VITE_RPC_MAINNET=

# Read-indexer base URL for the history views (treasury-ui, seal-ui). Optional display data.
# VITE_INDEXER_URL=https://sui-indexer.meddleware.co.uk

# Token Deployer fee treasury (VITE_FEE_TREASURY_TESTNET / VITE_FEE_TREASURY_MAINNET) is committed in
# .env.production: a public address, not a build arg.
